    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just guilt. its like i've realized i'm just a bystander in life. a hollow person. people around me deserve someone who actually cares, someone who has a soul. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person anymore. i just see someone who shouldn't be taking up space that a real person could use.",
